      "replacement_text": "\\item there exists a finite ring map $R \\to R'$ which is not\nan isomorphism, has kernel and cokernel annihilated by a power of\n$\\mathfrak m$, satisfies $\\mathfrak m \\notin \\operatorname{Ass}(R')$,\nand has $R' \\not = 0$.",
