      "old_sha256": "EB2966B3B19428E5364D5FAC2DAC186347721CC2804532A2CD33857971744C94",
      "old_text": "On the other hand, if the completion of $R$ in all of its maximal\nideals is reduced, then the procedure stops (insert future reference\nhere).",
      "operation_index": 1,
      "producer_id": "ALGEBRA-270",
