      "replacement_sha256": "6A05B4A8045E2EDAE50816870055F57DB2BDA1386BB42351F3992743883583A6",
      "replacement_text": "On the other hand, if the completion of $R$ at each of its maximal\nideals is reduced, then the procedure stops.",
